      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Qwen-Image-Edit Rapid AIO (NSFW v23)\n\nPhr00t's merge of Qwen-Image-Edit-2511 with Lightning accelerators and NSFW LoRAs; the text encoder and VAE are in the same checkpoint.\n\n- **4 steps, cfg 1, euler_ancestral / beta** (the author's recommendation for v23); 4-8 steps all work.\n- Write the instruction as an edit (\"Replace ... with ...\", \"Change the background to ...\"). Text to change goes in double quotes.\n- **More references**: add Load Image nodes into *image2* / *image3* of the edit instruction and refer to them as Picture 1, 2, 3.\n- **No input image**: remove it from *image1* and feed the sampler an Empty Latent Image for plain text to image.\n- The output follows image 1's aspect ratio at ~1 MP (Scale Image to Total Pixels).\n- Only edit photos of real people with their consent.\n- Images are saved without the prompt or workflow embedded."
      ],
      "title": "Notes",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
